{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "tb-v3-2026-05-25",
    "name": "Titik Baik API",
    "description": "Koleksi lengkap REST API Titik Baik (v3).\n\n**Versi:** 2026-05-25 — sinkron dgn migration_v3.sql (avatar, category, goal_amount, community, notifications).\n\n## Cara pakai\n1. Import file environment `TitikBaik.postman_environment.json`.\n2. Set `base_url` (default `http://localhost:3000`).\n3. Jalankan **Auth → Login Komunitas** (atau Donatur/Admin) → token otomatis tersimpan ke variable `token_komunitas` / `token_donatur` / `token_admin`.\n4. Variable `token` selalu mengikuti token login terakhir.\n\n## Catatan role\n- `donatur` — bisa rate, report, baca, update status ke 'On Progress'\n- `komunitas` — bisa buat & kelola titik bantuan, upload dokumentasi, buat post komunitas\n- `admin` — full access /api/admin/*",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [""] }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Registrasi, login, dan validasi token JWT.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Komunitas Berbagi Jogja\",\n  \"email\": \"komunitas+{{$timestamp}}@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"role\": \"komunitas\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/register", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "register"] },
            "description": "Buat akun baru. Role yang valid: `donatur` atau `komunitas` (admin dibuat manual via DB seed).\n\n**Response 201:** `{ message, userId }`\n**Response 409:** email sudah terdaftar"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Komunitas",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('token', res.token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('token_komunitas', res.token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('user_id_komunitas', res.user.id);",
                  "    console.log('Saved token_komunitas');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email_komunitas}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password_komunitas}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Login sebagai komunitas. Token disimpan otomatis ke `token` & `token_komunitas`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Donatur",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('token', res.token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('token_donatur', res.token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('user_id_donatur', res.user.id);",
                  "    console.log('Saved token_donatur');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email_donatur}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password_donatur}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('token', res.token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('token_admin', res.token);",
                  "    pm.environment.set('user_id_admin', res.user.id);",
                  "    console.log('Saved token_admin');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email_admin}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password_admin}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me (Validate Token)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/me", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "me"] },
            "description": "Validasi token aktif. Return `{ message, user: { userId, role, iat, exp } }`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Donations",
      "description": "Manajemen titik bantuan (donation_points).\n\n**Field baru v3:** `category`, `goal_amount`, `collected_amount`, `author_name`, `author_avatar`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List All",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/donations?page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "donations"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" },
                { "key": "urgency", "value": "Mendesak", "disabled": true, "description": "Mendesak | Normal | Rendah" },
                { "key": "status", "value": "Open", "disabled": true, "description": "Open | On Progress | Completed (default: Open)" },
                { "key": "category", "value": "Pangan", "disabled": true, "description": "Pangan | Medis | Pendidikan | Infrastruktur | Pakaian | Lainnya | Umum" },
                { "key": "search", "value": "banjir", "disabled": true, "description": "ILIKE pada title + description" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Public. Default hanya menampilkan status='Open' jika `status` tidak diisi. Response include `author_name`, `author_avatar`, `category`, `goal_amount`, `collected_amount`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get by ID",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/donations/{{point_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "donations", "{{point_id}}"] },
            "description": "Detail titik dgn agregat: `avg_rating`, `total_ratings`, `total_docs`, `creator_name`, `creator_avatar`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Nearby (Geo)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/donations/nearby?lat={{lat_jogja}}&lng={{lng_jogja}}&radius=5000",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "donations", "nearby"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "lat", "value": "{{lat_jogja}}", "description": "Latitude user" },
                { "key": "lng", "value": "{{lng_jogja}}", "description": "Longitude user" },
                { "key": "radius", "value": "5000", "description": "Radius dalam meter" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Titik bantuan dalam radius X meter, hanya status 'Open'. Urut dari yang terdekat."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.id) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('point_id', res.data.id);",
                  "    console.log('Saved point_id =', res.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Bantuan Pangan Korban Banjir Code\",\n  \"description\": \"Dibutuhkan beras, mie instan, dan air mineral untuk 50 KK terdampak banjir.\",\n  \"longitude\": 110.3695,\n  \"latitude\": -7.7956,\n  \"urgency\": \"Mendesak\",\n  \"category\": \"Pangan\",\n  \"goal_amount\": 5000000\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/donations", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "donations"] },
            "description": "**Role:** komunitas.\n\n**Field wajib:** `title`, `longitude`, `latitude`.\n**Field opsional:** `description`, `urgency` (default 'Normal'), `category` (default 'Umum'), `goal_amount` (default 0).\n\n`point_id` di-save otomatis untuk request berikutnya."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Bantuan Pangan Korban Banjir Code (UPDATE)\",\n  \"urgency\": \"Normal\",\n  \"category\": \"Pangan\",\n  \"goal_amount\": 7500000\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/donations/{{point_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "donations", "{{point_id}}"] },
            "description": "**Role:** komunitas (hanya pengelola).\nMinimal 1 field harus diisi: `title`, `description`, `urgency`, `category`, `goal_amount`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"On Progress\",\n  \"user_lat\": -7.7956,\n  \"user_lng\": 110.3695\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/donations/{{point_id}}/status", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "donations", "{{point_id}}", "status"] },
            "description": "**Role:** donatur atau komunitas.\n\n- `On Progress` → siapa saja yang login (donatur ambil bantuan)\n- `Completed` → **hanya pengelola** + geo-fencing (≤ 100m dari titik). Wajib kirim `user_lat`, `user_lng`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Documentation",
      "description": "Bukti foto distribusi (multipart upload ke Supabase Storage bucket `documentation`).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List by Point",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/documentation/{{point_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "documentation", "{{point_id}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "point_id", "value": "{{point_id}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "caption", "value": "Distribusi tahap pertama, 25 paket", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "photo", "type": "file", "src": [] }
              ]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/documentation", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "documentation"] },
            "description": "**Role:** komunitas.\n**Body:** `multipart/form-data` — field `photo` (file image/*, max 5MB), `point_id`, `caption`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Ratings",
      "description": "Rating & review titik bantuan.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List by Point",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/ratings/{{point_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "ratings", "{{point_id}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Give Rating",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"point_id\": {{point_id}},\n  \"score\": 5,\n  \"review\": \"Distribusi cepat dan tepat sasaran.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/ratings", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "ratings"] },
            "description": "**Role:** donatur. 1 user 1 rating per point (UNIQUE constraint)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Reports",
      "description": "Laporan titik bantuan invalid (anti-fraud).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Report",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"point_id\": {{point_id}},\n  \"reason\": \"Lokasi tidak ada bantuan saat dicek di lapangan.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/reports", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "reports"] },
            "description": "**Role:** donatur."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin",
      "description": "Endpoint admin-only. Login dengan **Login Admin** dulu agar `token_admin` aktif.",
      "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token_admin}}", "type": "string" }]
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Reports",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/reports?page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "admin", "reports"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" },
                { "key": "status", "value": "pending", "disabled": true, "description": "pending | resolved | dismissed" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Report Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"resolved\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/reports/{{report_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "admin", "reports", "{{report_id}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "System Stats",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/stats", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "admin", "stats"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Invalid Point (soft)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/points/{{point_id}}", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "admin", "points", "{{point_id}}"] },
            "description": "Soft delete: set `deleted_at = NOW()`. Tidak hilang dari DB."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Analytics",
      "description": "Statistik publik untuk landing/dashboard.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Summary Stats",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/analytics/stats", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "analytics", "stats"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Heatmap",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/analytics/heatmap", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "analytics", "heatmap"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "description": "Profil user, avatar, riwayat aktivitas.\n\n**Baru v3:** `avatar_url`, `donation_count`, `points_helped`, `total_donation` (semantik per-role), endpoint upload avatar.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/profile", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "profile"] },
            "description": "Response include stats per-role:\n- **komunitas/admin:** `donation_count` (jumlah titik dibuat), `points_helped` (titik completed), `total_donation` (sum goal_amount titik dibuat)\n- **donatur:** `donation_count` (jumlah rating), `points_helped` (titik completed yg dirate), `total_donation` (sum goal_amount titik dirate yg completed)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Komunitas Berbagi Jogja\",\n  \"bio\": \"Komunitas relawan bencana Yogyakarta.\",\n  \"avatar_url\": \"https://example.com/avatar.png\"\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/profile", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "profile"] },
            "description": "Field `avatar_url` opsional. Untuk upload file, gunakan **Upload Avatar** sebagai gantinya."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload Avatar",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "avatar", "type": "file", "src": [], "description": "image/*, max 5MB" }
              ]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/avatar", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "avatar"] },
            "description": "**Multipart upload** ke Supabase Storage bucket `avatars` (public). Response include URL avatar publik yang sudah disimpan ke `users.avatar_url`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Activity",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/activity?page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "users", "activity"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Shape uniform: `{ id, title, subtitle, type, created_at, ... }`.\n- **komunitas/admin:** `type='donation_managed'`, `subtitle='<status> • <urgency>'`\n- **donatur:** `type='rating_given'`, `subtitle='Memberi nilai N/5'`"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Community",
      "description": "Modul komunitas: posts, comments, likes (BARU di v3).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Posts",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/community/posts?tab=terbaru&page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "community", "posts"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "tab", "value": "terbaru", "description": "terbaru | populer | diskusi" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Public, **optional auth** (kalau Authorization header dikirim, field `liked_by_me` akurat).\n\n- `tab=terbaru` → ORDER BY created_at DESC\n- `tab=populer` → ORDER BY likes_count DESC\n- `tab=diskusi` → filter post_type IN ('bantuanDibutuhkan','pertanyaan')\n\nResponse include `author_name`, `author_avatar`, `author_role`, `comments_count`, `liked_by_me`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Post",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.data && res.data.id) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('post_id', res.data.id);",
                  "    console.log('Saved post_id =', res.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"Update: distribusi paket pangan tahap 2 selesai. Terima kasih kepada para donatur!\",\n  \"post_type\": \"updateKomunitas\",\n  \"image_url\": null\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/community/posts", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "community", "posts"] },
            "description": "**Role:** komunitas.\n\n`post_type`: `bantuanDibutuhkan` | `pertanyaan` | `updateKomunitas` (default) | `inspirasi` | `kisahSukses`.\n\n`post_id` di-save otomatis."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Toggle Like",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/community/posts/{{post_id}}/like", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "community", "posts", "{{post_id}}", "like"] },
            "description": "Toggle: jika sudah like → unlike, sebaliknya like. Response: `{ liked: bool, likes_count: int }`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Comments",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/community/posts/{{post_id}}/comments?page=1&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "community", "posts", "{{post_id}}", "comments"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Comment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"Terima kasih atas updatenya, semangat terus!\"\n}"
            },
